1. Click "Join" to join this round;
2. Other people that directly take the mic can also join the game;
3. You need at least 2 people to start the game;
4. In order to be fair, after the game starts, you cannot remove the player from the game until that user is eliminated or the game is over;
5. By clicking ❤, you can review the game guidelines;

1. The countdown of each round is selected by the owner;
2. After the end of the countdown, the sniper will shoot to eliminate the targeted people;
3. After eliminating one person, the countdown of the next round will start immediately ;

1. The score of the people who've been eliminated will not continue, so the scoreboard will be eliminated;
2. Users with mics won't be able to join the game in the middle of the game;
3. If you drop the mic or leave the room in the middle of the game, you will be considered as a quitter. You will be eliminated and won't be able to go back to the game;
4. Changing seats will not affect the score;

